1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:02,091
Wh... You're
suggesting

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:04,666
(Sheldon:)that I have emotional issues
below my consciousness

3
00:00:04,665 --> 00:00:06,395
which drive my behavior,

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,400
(Sheldon:)thus causing me to lash out
at anything or anyone

5
00:00:09,403 --> 00:00:11,933
(Sheldon:)that threatens
my intellectual superiority.

6
00:00:11,939 --> 00:00:14,409
(Leonard:)Might be something
to think about.

7
00:00:15,376 --> 00:00:16,806
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

8
00:00:16,811 --> 00:00:18,341
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

9
00:00:18,346 --> 00:00:20,016
(Sheldon:)Howard's allergic to peanuts.

10
00:00:20,014 --> 00:00:21,984
(Sheldon:)How can I use that against him?

11
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:27,417
(Raj:)Hey.

12
00:00:27,421 --> 00:00:31,261
(Sheldon:)Okay, now that everyone's here,
we can begin.

13
00:00:33,227 --> 00:00:35,897
(Howard:)Before we do,
I just talked to Leonard.

14
00:00:35,896 --> 00:00:37,296
(Howard:)And if you're gonna

15
00:00:37,298 --> 00:00:39,868
(Howard:)spend all your time
trying to belittle me

16
00:00:39,867 --> 00:00:42,667
(Howard:)by making this class
unnecessarily hard,

17
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,600
(Howard:)then I'm out.

18
00:00:44,605 --> 00:00:46,105
(Howard:)But if you're interested
in making

19
00:00:46,107 --> 00:00:48,837
(Howard:)a sincere effort
to be a good teacher,

20
00:00:48,843 --> 00:00:51,543
(Howard:)then I'm willing
to give this a shot.

21
00:00:54,148 --> 00:00:56,748
(Sheldon:)I suppose that's a fair request.

22
00:00:56,751 --> 00:01:00,221
(Sheldon:)There's no reason we both can't
benefit from this experience.

